# Cel shadow on the side away from the upper-left light: a hard crescent where `form` shifted by
# `shift` no longer covers it, plus a softer core. Nest it under `form`.
def cel form:@self tone:p.shadow shift:-30,-28 core:.4
  subtract fill:mix(shade(tone -1) shade(tone -2) core) a:.9 blur:1.2
    copy form
    copy form at:shift
  subtract fill:shade(tone -2) a:.35 blur:8
    copy form
    copy form at:shift*.45
